{"channelId":"UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","row":["Horse Illustrated",221,"Since 1977, Horse Illustrated has served the hands-on horse owner by promoting the best in horse management, riding and training for all breeds and styles of riding. Along with our website, HorseChannel.com, Horse Illustrated provides the latest horse news plus essential information about equine health, nutrition, grooming  and all aspects of horse care plus English and western training solutions, breed profiles and more. Horse Illustrated’s in-depth articles come from respected resources and top industry experts.\n\nThe editors of Horse Illustrated also produce Your New Horse, an annual reference guide that provides first-time and beginner horse owners with everything they need to know about caring for a horse. Horse Illustrated, Your New Horse and HorseChannel.com are part of the I-5 Publications stable of magazines and books. I-5 Publications is the leader in special interest pet magazines, trade magazines, books and websites dedicated to pet-loving consumers.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:49.562Z","channelId":"UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"653804b5d7dfaac1c838f6b48aec7015ca5ec71997984c130baed9357162882b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9074226efda842264a052b8ba4eec8703716bbf75c17b01dd6f0f4d2ed9595f7"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:11:26.961Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":221,"raw":"221 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxmkXvNVN7Kq0SJDghGQrg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:49.562Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPage